sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI
    participant API as SSE endpoint
    participant BUS as EventBus
    UI->>API: GET /alerts/stream (EventSource)
    API->>BUS: subscribe("alerts") -> Queue
    loop while connected
        BUS-->>API: event
        API-->>UI: data: {json}
    end
    UI->>API: disconnect
    API->>BUS: unsubscribe()
